      "writtenOn": "2015-04-20T00:41:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In the make-based build system, we don\u0027t do this, because there may be many rules generating .java files to the LOCAL_INTERMEDIATE_SOURCE_DIR. We take the advantage that the function compile-java includes any java files found in that dir.\nSo you may delete files just generated by another rule.",
